          "subject": "Sejlløb flyttes. Afmærkning flyttes. Afmærket forbudsområde justeres.",
          "details": "<p><strong>Medio&nbsp;juli&nbsp;2024,</strong>&nbsp;vil de afm&aelig;rkede &oslash;st- og vestg&aring;ende sejll&oslash;b p&aring; position 1) - 15), ved den nye Storstr&oslash;msbro, blive flyttet til position 16) - 30) som anf&oslash;rt.&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"position-table\">\n<tbody>\n<tr><!-- From position -->\n<td class=\"pos-index\">1)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 58,319'N - 011&deg; 51,760'E</td>\n<td>gr&oslash;n spidst&oslash;nde, Q.G</td>\n<!-- To position -->\n<td class=\"pos-index\">16)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 58,188'N - 011&deg; 51,705'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><!-- From position -->\n<td class=\"pos-index\">2)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 58,286'N - 011&deg; 51,973'E</td>\n<td>gr&oslash;n spidst&oslash;nde, Q.G</td>\n<!-- To position -->\n<td class=\"pos-index\">17)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 58,160'N - 011&deg; 51,919'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><!-- From position -->\n<td class=\"pos-index\">3)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 58,282'N - 011&deg; 52,000'E</td>\n<td>gr&oslash;n spidst&oslash;nde, Q.G</td>\n<!-- To position -->\n<td class=\"pos-index\">18)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 58,156'N - 011&deg; 51,946'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><!-- From position -->\n<td class=\"pos-index\">4)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 58,256'N - 011&deg; 52,167'E</td>\n<td>gr&oslash;n spidst&oslash;nde, Q.G</td>\n<!-- To position -->\n<td class=\"pos-index\">19)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 58,134'N - 011&deg; 52,115'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><!-- From position -->\n<td class=\"pos-index\">5)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 58,183'N - 011&deg; 52,425'E</td>\n<td>gr&oslash;n spidst&oslash;nde, Q.G</td>\n<!-- To position -->\n<td class=\"pos-index\">20)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 58,067'N - 011&deg; 52,378'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><!-- From position -->\n<td class=\"pos-index\">6)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 58,356'N - 011&deg; 51,778'E</td>\n<td>midtfarvandsafm&aelig;rkning, Iso.2s</td>\n<!-- To position