        {
          "lang": "en",
          "details": "<p>The prohibited areas have been established by the DMA in accordance with consolidated act&nbsp;no. 221 of 11 February 2022 on safety at sea, Section 6 (i and vii). Contraventions of the&nbsp;prohibition are punishable in accordance with the same Act, Section 28 (iii).</p>"
        }
